exports[`'invitation' email > has a plain-text part with the footer and no markup 1`] = `
"Join Acme on Trailmark
======================

Sami Nasser (sami@acme.test) invited you to the Acme workspace as an Admin. Trailmark keeps a searchable history of who did what, when and where across your team’s systems.

Workspace:       Acme
Role:            Admin
                 Manages projects, API keys, retention and members.
Invited address: lina@acme.test
Expires:         Nov 7, 2026, 14:32 UTC (in 2 days)

Accept the invitation:
https://audit.acme.test/accept-invitation/inv_7Hc2kP9xQm

Not expecting this? You can ignore it — you won’t join Acme unless you accept. To accept, sign in as lina@acme.test; the invitation only works for that address.

--
You received this email because sami@acme.test invited lina@acme.test to the Acme workspace.
Trailmark · open-source audit logs · audit.acme.test
https://audit.acme.test
"
`;

